    {
      "kind": "datasheet",
      "url": "https://global-uploads.webflow.com/5f4013c686a8c427bc62226e/5f4013c686a8c4841f62246e_Midas-M32-Data-Sheet.pdf",
      "note": "Midas M32 product information document (downloaded, read with pdftotext 2026-11-12): connectors 32 Midas PRO microphone preamps (XLR), 1 talkback microphone input (XLR), 2 RCA in / out, 16 XLR outputs, 2 monitoring outputs (XLR / 1/4 in TRS balanced), 6 aux in / out (1/4 in TRS balanced), phones output 2 (stereo, 1/4 in TRS), AES/EBU out (XLR), 2 AES50 ports (Klark Teknik SuperMAC), expansion card interface, Ultranet P-16, 1 MIDI in / out, USB type A (audio and data import / export), USB type B and RJ45 for remote control (rear panel); power: auto-ranging 100-240 VAC switch-mode supply (the sheet does not name the inlet: IEC C14 is taken as the usual connector, said here). Modelled subset: 8 of 32 mic inputs, talkback, 6 of 16 XLR outputs (main L / R, mono, 3 mixes), 1 aux in and out, 2 monitor outputs as TRS, 1 of the 2 headphone outputs, AES out, AES50 A / B (the sheet does not name the connector: etherCON assumed), USB-A, the mains inlet. Not modelled: RCA, card slot, Ultranet, MIDI, USB-B and RJ45 (remote control). Size 891 x 612 x 256 mm, 25 kg (sheet). Slab profile is an estimate: the sources give only the outer sizes (rear height at the io edge, a lower front lip); the real desk is not a straight wedge. All connector positions are guesses (the sheet has no drawing); the top picture is a generic 16-strip layout."
    },
    {
      "kind": "datasheet",
      "url": "https://global-uploads.webflow.com/5f4013c686a8c427bc62226e/5f4013c686a8c4841f62246e_Midas-M32-Data-Sheet.pdf",
      "note": "Phantom power (review fix, read 2026-11-12 by a research pass): the Midas M32 data sheet lists 32 XLR mic preamps with +48 V phantom, switchable per input (the eight modelled mic inputs). It says nothing of phantom on the TALKBACK input, so that port no longer claims it (phantom to-check)."
    }
  ]
